WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Welcome to Earn Your Voice: Playing Time, Club

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.960
Fit & Opportunity. I’m Brian Kennedy Jr. Your

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.680
goal is a respectful meeting and opportunity plan.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.360
Record one observable event and draft one respectful

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.200
question about expectations. Keep your work private, record

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.200
what you tried, and set a review date.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.280
Playing time, selection and opportunities are not guaranteed;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.760
no retaliation or pressure tactics.
